---
/**
 * 4-Punkte-Check Sektion
 */
---

<section id="pruefung" class="rwm relative z-10" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CheckSection.astro:xqns3t">
  <div class="wrap" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CheckSection.astro:wrap01">
    <div class="head-wrap flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-4" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CheckSection.astro:headwrap01">
      <div class="max-w-3xl" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CheckSection.astro:headtext01">
        <div class="tag" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CheckSection.astro:tag01">✓ &nbsp;4-PUNKTE-CHECK</div>
        <h2 class="md:text-[34px] lg:text-[38px] md:text-left !my-2" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CheckSection.astro:h201">Was wir bei einer Rauchmelder-Kontrolle prüfen</h2>
        <p class="lead" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CheckSection.astro:lead01">Vier klare Prüfpunkte, damit Sie sofort wissen, was passt, was fehlt und was wirklich gemacht werden muss.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="shrink-0 flex items-center justify-end max-md:hidden" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CheckSection.astro:headimg01">
        <picture style="display:contents">
          <source
            type="image/avif"
            srcset="/images/rauchmelder-freisteller-256.avif 256w, /images/rauchmelder-freisteller-320.avif 320w"
            sizes="170px"
          />
          <source
            type="image/webp"
            srcset="/images/rauchmelder-freisteller-256.webp 256w, /images/rauchmelder-freisteller-320.webp 320w"
            sizes="170px"
          />
          <img
            src="/images/rauchmelder-freisteller-320.webp"
            width="320"
            height="251"
            alt="Rauchmelder"
            class="w-32 lg:w-40 h-auto object-contain drop-shadow-md select-none pointer-events-none"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CheckSection.astro:rmimg01"
          />
        </picture>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="checkgrid" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CheckSection.astro:grid01">
      <div class="points" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CheckSection.astro:pts01">
        <article data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CheckSection.astro:art01"><i>✓</i><div data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CheckSection.astro:5j2ij1"><h3 data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CheckSection.astro:fy6009">Sind alle Pflichtbereiche ausgestattet?</h3><p data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CheckSection.astro:io4y9l">Wir prüfen, ob alle erforderlichen Räume mit Meldern ausgestattet sind.</p></div></article>
        <article data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CheckSection.astro:art02"><i>✓</i><div data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CheckSection.astro:5j2ij0"><h3 data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CheckSection.astro:fy6008">Sitzt jeder Melder richtig?</h3><p data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CheckSection.astro:7h573j">Wir prüfen Position, Abstand und freie Funktion an der Decke.</p></div></article>
        <article data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CheckSection.astro:art03"><i>✓</i><div data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CheckSection.astro:5j2iiz"><h3 data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CheckSection.astro:fy6007">Funktioniert jeder Melder zuverlässig?</h3><p data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CheckSection.astro:7h573k">Wir testen Alarm, Zustand und sichtbare Mängel jedes Geräts.</p></div></article>
        <article data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CheckSection.astro:art04"><i>✓</i><div data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CheckSection.astro:5j2iiy"><h3 data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CheckSection.astro:fy6006">Ist ein Austausch wirklich nötig?</h3><p data-ps="src/components/home/v2/CheckSection.astro:7h573s">Wir empfehlen Ersatz nur bei festgestelltem Bedarf.</p></div></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.rwm,.rwm *{box-sizing:border-box}
.rwm{font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif;color:#082b50;background:transparent;padding:36px 0 28px}
.wrap{width:100%;max-width:1500px;margin-inline:auto;padding-inline:20px}@media(min-width:768px){.wrap{padding-inline:60px}}@media(min-width:1280px){.wrap{padding-inline:115px}}
.tag{display:inline-block;padding:5px 14px;border-radius:30px;background:#e8f8ec;color:#08793a;font-size:13px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:1.5px}
.rwm h2{margin:8px 0 4px; line-height:1.05; letter-spacing:-1.8px; font-weight:900;}
.lead{margin:0;color:#425c79;font-size:clamp(15px,1.2vw,18px);line-height:1.35}
.checkgrid{display:grid;gap:12px;align-items:stretch}
.points{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}
.points article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:44px 1fr;gap:16px;align-items:center;padding:12px 18px;border:1px solid #dbe6ef;border-radius:14px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 6px 16px #0d35520a}
.points h3{margin:0 0 3px;font-size:clamp(15px,1.15vw,18px);line-height:1.2;font-weight:900}
.points p{margin:0;color:#415a77;font-size:clamp(12.5px,0.92vw,14px);line-height:1.35}
.points article>i{width:44px;height:44px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:50%;background:#e5f8eb;color:#0a9145;font-size:22px;font-style:normal;font-weight:900}

@media(max-width:1000px){
 .points{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
 .points article{grid-template-columns:40px 1fr;gap:12px;padding:12px}
 .points article>i{width:40px;height:40px;font-size:20px}
}

@media(max-width:680px){
 .rwm{padding:20px 0 28px}
 .rwm h2{letter-spacing:-1.4px;}
 .lead{margin-bottom:14px;font-size:14px}
 .points{grid-template-columns:1fr}
 .points article{grid-template-columns:38px 1fr;gap:12px;padding:12px}
 .points article>i{width:38px;height:38px;font-size:18px}
 .points h3{font-size:16px}
 .points p{font-size:13px}
}
</style>
